 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP XVIII · SIN: THE FACE — DECK OF THE FAHRENHEIT — ABOVE BEVELLE T Tidus S.LV 180 Y Yuna S.LV 175 A Auron S.LV 180 W Wakka S.LV 165 L Lulu S.LV 170 R Rikku S.LV 160 K Kimahri S.LV 150 CHAPTER STATS SPHERE GRID EQUIPMENT ITEMS OVERDRIVE FFX · XVIII Sin: the Face Before the Mouth Opens Sin fell into Bevelle and rose again with wings. The main gun is still broken, so Cid flies the ship straight at its face, and the mouth begins to open. Bevelle, below the wings nose to nose with it he is waiting OBJECTIVES Ride out the pull Bring Sin below half Defeat Sin before the mouth opens TIP Wakka and Lulu in and Hastega during the three pulls; Armor Break the moment it is in range; then everything, Overdrives included. Any Ward stops Gaze. ▲ ▼ PARTY · ◀ ▶ TABS · ENTER BEGINS THE BATTLE · ESC BACK START BATTLE T Tidus HP 6492/6492 · MP 140/140 WARRIOR Y Yuna HP 5130/5130 · MP 320/320 SUMMONER A Auron HP 6492/6492 · MP 100/100 SENTINEL",
